JfZc4VzGuUtqAJjveqH8UA&oe=69DCEA09"}, "display_name": "Unknown Lands", "keywords": ["Unknown", "Lands", "horror", "pyramid", "egypt"], "long_description": "Update 6.0 is here!! New enemies, improved visuals and many more!\n\nUncover hidden mysteries in this story driven action-adventure game. Rooted deeply within the Egyptian mythology, buckle up for a thrilling adventure!\n\nSolve puzzles and combat the creatures of the dark, with style! Just a warning: Unknown Lands come with unprecedented dangers and dark secrets.\n\nThis game features:\n- Story campaign\n- Interesting puzzles\n- Characters in Egyptian mythology\n- Range of weapons for combat\n- Three acts set in different worlds! \n\nMay the light of RA shines upon you! ", "short_description": "Update 6.0 is here!! New enemies, improved visuals and many more!\n\nUncover hidden mysteries in this story driven action-adventure game. Rooted deeply within the Egyptian mythology, buckle up for a thrilling adventure!\n\nSolve puzzles and combat the creatures of the dark! Unknown Lands come with unprecedented dangers and dark secrets.\n\nThe game features:\n- Story campaign\n- Interesting puzzles\n- Characters in Egyptian mythology\n- Range of weapons for combat\n- Three acts set in different worlds! "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bugbystudios.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bugbystudios.com/terms.html", "publisher_name": "BUGBY STUDIOS LLP", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bugbystudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "rec